and version 1.3c or later is part of all distributions of LaTeX version
2008 or later.

This work has the LPPL maintenance status `maintained'.

The Current Maintainer of this work is Takuya MASUDA.

This work consists of the files jsr.bbx, jsr.cbx, jsr.dbx and lbx/*-jsr.lbx
(the style), together with the documentation in README.md and manual/ and the
regression tests in tests/.  Parts of jsr.cbx are adapted from biblatex-apa.

The style guide of the Japanese Sociological Society (社会学評論スタイルガイド)
is a copyrighted work and is not included in this repository.
